    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. but he's barely sipping the water and he still looks so weak. i feel like a pinch of salt isn't enough to really help him if he's losing so much liquid. i have some adult salt tablets in the medicine cabinet, can i just crush one up and mix it into his juice or something? just a little bit i think would help him more than just plain water.",
